  "description": "Jong-Hyeon is your average college student with a crush on a girl who’s dating somebody else. The fact that the guy she’s dating is a total jerk is just salt on the wound. Meanwhile, his classmate Seo-Jin happens to have a crush on that total jerk. After sharing drinks and sob stories, the two of them end up having sex. That’s not a big deal. The big deal is the scheme that Seo-Jin proposes to him to get their respective crushes to break up. It might be the worst idea ever, but it’s an offer that he can’t refuse…\n\n(Source: Lezhin X, edited)",
